ility, cross-reference adjudication\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n- \\\"Session readers re-read the whole transcript on every hook call\\\": ruled out; readers take a bounded tail window (iteration 1, evidence: `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs`).\\n- \\\"The plugin constructs a subprocess per prompt without a guard\\\": ruled out; the fallback path is budgeted and short-circuits (iteration 2, evidence: `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: traceability\\n- Focus area: docs-versus-code drift for the reviewed surfaces — `feature-catalog/cli-surface/*.md`, `feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md`, `hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md`, `hooks/lib/README.md`, `.opencode/plugins/README.md`, and the `runtime-mirrors` README.\\n- Reason: D1 and D2 raised three P1 findings whose fixes will change documented behaviour; the docs must be checked before the P1 set freezes.\\n- Rotation status: D1 complete, D2 complete, D3 next, D4 after.\\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: `.d.mts` parity stays blocked; reader-vs-test comparison stays productive.\\n- Required evidence: `file:line` on both sides of every doc claim, plus a named test or code path that contradicts it.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: the 53 `render-hooks-plugin` rows of `review/review-scope.txt`. The area is the hook/plugin rendering surface: `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js`, `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/*` (`claude`, `devin`, `dsh`, `pi`, `index`), the advisor runtime render/embedder/subprocess modules, the advisor CLI, and the runtime-mirror sync scripts.\\n- Behaviour claims to verify: the advise hook must offer at most one command and must never auto-run a mutating command; each runtime reader must be isolated so one runtime's transcript cannot inject text into another's brief; holdout rows are never read by tune/fix/report paths.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `sk-code` review doctrine; `system-deep-loop` deep-review packet; the sibling lineages own scorer, accuracy-runner and doctor-install surfaces.\\n- Review risks and gaps: no `resource-map.md` at init, so the coverage gate is skipped; `codex` has no session reader in this area, so its behaviour is evidenced through the plugin/CLI path only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | partial | 1 | Spec docs describe the offer contract; code paths for two runtimes not yet exercised. |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | No checklist evidence read yet. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Pending iteration 3. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Pending iteration 3. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Pending iteration 3. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No manual-testing playbook row in this area. |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js` | D1, D2 | 2 | 0 P0, 1 P1, 1 P2 | partial |\\n| `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/` (`claude`, `devin`, `dsh`, `pi`, `index`) | D1, D2 | 2 | 0 P0, 2 P1, 2 P2 | partial |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts` | D1, D2 | 2 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | partial |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts` | D1 | 1 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | partial |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/subprocess.ts` | D2 | 2 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | partial |\\n| remaining 48 scope files | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 5\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-render-hooks-plugin-1794550137809-1ecgc7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-13T06:12:00.000Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794550382974,"end":1794550412183}}}}
