{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550436146,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799690ffeJQrMJ5OzboPGaV","part":{"partID":"prt_1d38a50c5001215bBVdtq5yWoc","sessionID":"ses_e2c799690ffeJQrMJ5OzboPGaV","messageID":"msg_1d38a38aa001vfEtiAaR9N9S4G","type":"tool","id":"call_a9e66ff72643487ba9d648dd","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - render-hooks-plugin lineage\ndescription: Session tracking for the render-hooks-plugin fan-out lineage of the command-surfacing review.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for the `render-hooks-plugin` fan-out lineage. Records which dimensions remain, what was found (P0/P1/P2), what review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Read by the executor at every iteration.\n- Updated in place after each iteration; machine-owned blocks stay inside their markers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview of command surfacing for the `render-hooks-plugin` area of\n`specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\nScope files are the `render-hooks-plugin` rows of `review/review-scope.txt` (53 files),\nplus shared docs that describe them (`.skilled/agents/orchestrate.md`,\n`.skilled/skills/sk-doc/*`, `system-skill-advisor` root docs).\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Implementing or editing any reviewed file. The review is observation-only.\n- Re-tuning the advisor scorer, embedders or the command corpus.\n- Reading or reproducing holdout prompt text. Counts only.\n- Reviewing areas owned by the sibling lineages (`scorer-attach`, `accuracy-runner`, `doctor-install`) beyond the shared docs that describe this area's surfaces.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence threshold 0.1 on the weighted new-findings ratio, minimum 2 iterations, stop policy `convergence`.\n- Hard ceiling `maxIterations = 5`.\n- A P0 that would need immediate operator action ends the loop early with `FAIL` and an escalation note.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: D1 correctness, D2 security, D3 traceability, D4 maintainability\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js`, `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/*.mjs`, `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts`, `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts`.\n- Reason: the offer path is the area's core behaviour; correctness first so later dimensions have a stable contract to check against.\n- Rotation status: D1 first, then D2 security, D3 traceability, D4 maintainability.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet.\n- Required evidence: `file:line` on the executed path plus the test that covers it.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: the 53 `render-hooks-plugin` rows of `review/review-scope.txt`. The area is the hook/plugin rendering surface: `.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js`, `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/*` (`claude`, `devin`, `dsh`, `pi`, `index`), the advisor runtime render/embedder/subprocess modules, the advisor CLI, and the runtime-mirror sync scripts.\n- Behaviour claims to verify: the advise hook must offer at most one command and must never auto-run a mutating command; each runtime reader must be isolated so one runtime's transcript cannot inject text into another's brief; holdout rows are never read by tune/fix/report paths.\n- Reuse and conventions: `sk-code` review doctrine; `system-deep-loop` deep-review packet; the sibling lineages own scorer, accuracy-runner and doctor-install surfaces.\n- Review risks and gaps: no `resource-map.md` at init, so the coverage gate is skipped; `codex` has no session reader in this area, so its behaviour is evidenced through the plugin/CLI path only.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not started. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not started. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Not started. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Not started. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Not started. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Not started. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| 53 scope files | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-render-hooks-plugin-1794550137809-1ecgc7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T06:12:00.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/render-hooks-plugin/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wrote file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/rout